<!DOCTYPE html>
<html data-theme="dark">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>About - KravN</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
  <script src="/js/theme.js"></script>
</head>
<body>
  <%- include('partials/navbar', { currentPage: 'about' }) %>

 <div class="about-hero">
  <div class="about-hero-poster-strip">
    <% if (typeof posters !== 'undefined' && posters.length) { %>
      <% posters.slice(0, 12).forEach(url => { %>
        <img src="<%= url %>" alt="" onerror="this.remove()">
      <% }); %>
    <% } %>
  </div>
  <div class="about-hero-overlay"></div>
  <div class="about-hero-content">
    <span class="about-eyebrow">The Story</span>
    <h1>Welcome to Krav<span class="accent-n">N</span></h1>
    <p class="about-tagline">Where movie theories become discussions.</p>
  </div>
</div>

  <div class="page-narrow">
    <div class="about-section">
      <p>
        Ever finished a movie and immediately thought,
        <span class="highlight">"Wait... did anyone else notice that?"</span>
      </p>
      <p>
        Or spent way too much time explaining why your theory is actually better than the writer's?
      </p>
      <p>
        That's exactly why <strong>KravN</strong> exists.
      </p>
      <p>
        A place for movie lovers, binge-watchers, and people who simply have too many opinions about films and web series.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="sprocket-divider">
      <div class="holes"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
    </div>

    <div class="about-section">
      <span class="about-section-eyebrow">Behind the code</span>
      <h2>The story behind KravN</h2>
      <p>Hey! I'm <span class="highlight">Sahaj Jain</span>.</p>
      <p>I'm a Computer Science student who enjoys building things and watching way too many movies.</p>
      <p>
        KravN started as a learning project and somehow turned into my first deployed web application.
        Along the way I learned databases, authentication, deployment, debugging, and how one tiny bug
        can ruin an otherwise peaceful evening.
      </p>
      <p>This is only the beginning. More features, better discussions, and a lot more movie debates are coming soon.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="sprocket-divider">
      <div class="holes"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
    </div>

    <div class="about-section about-section-closing">
      <h2>Hope y'all have fun posting movie theories and reviews...</h2>

      <div class="contact-links">
        <a href="mailto:jainsahaj167@gmail.com" class="contact-pill">
          📧 jainsahaj167@gmail.com
        </a>
      </div>

      <p class="closing-line">Alright, now go post your hottest movie take. →</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>